WEBVTT

00:10:28.600 --> 00:10:31.496
Sasa, ikiwa umekaa hapa kwa wasikilizaji 
na umesema,

00:10:31.520 --> 00:10:33.936
"Ndiyo, kweli, hiyo si mimi 
na sikubaliani nayo,"

00:10:33.960 --> 00:10:35.446
basi njoo uchukue somo langu --

00:10:35.446 --> 00:10:36.976
(Kicheko)

00:10:37.000 --> 00:10:40.680
ili nikuoneshe ni kiasi gani cha pesa 
inakugharimu kila unaposhikwa na hisia.

00:10:41.960 --> 00:10:45.120
(Makofi na Vifijo)

00:10:47.600 --> 00:10:49.136
Asanteni sana. Asanteni.

00:10:49.160 --> 00:10:50.320
(Makofi na Vifijo)